    -> obligation-pydantic-schemas  [compatibility/explicit]
       Represent typed schemas as pydantic models.

[constraint-16] Tests issue no live model calls.
    -> obligation-no-live-model-calls-in-tests  [compatibility/explicit]
       Keep tests free of live model calls.

[exclusion-01] De-duplicating obligations, and attaching a requirement to an obligation
